; DT818_pro_v3 - 6-stream ORB rank portfolio + 6 REVERSE-hedge sub-streams
; Generated 2026-05-16, hedge params refreshed 2026-05-17 (may16_may9 rotation, round 7 hedge WFO — final).
; Use with ea/DT818_pro_v3.mq5 (recompiled 2026-05-16 with _HEDGE_Sn_SLMult input + risk-equalized lots).
;
; PARENT total risk: 9.0% (1.5% x 6 streams). Range filter DISABLED.
;   S1-S3 = MAY9 R1-R3 (PREVIOUS-week WFO), magics 1111/2222/3333
;   S4-S6 = MAY16 R2/R3/R4 (CURRENT-week WFO, R1+R5 dedup-skipped), magics 4444/5555/6666
;
; REVERSE-HEDGE config (from wfo_hedge_reverse_may16/winner.json round 4):
;   Direction:    OPPOSITE of parent
;   Order type:   LIMIT at parent's original entry price
;   SL distance:  parent_SL_pts * sl_mult  (NEW 2026-05-16: per-stream sweep, was hardcoded 1.0)
;   TP distance:  parent_SL_pts * tp_mult  (per-stream sweep, relative to PARENT SL)
;   Lots:         parent_lots / sl_mult    (NEW 2026-05-16: risk-equalized — dollar-loss on hedge SL
;                                            = dollar-loss on parent SL regardless of sl_mult)
;   Global expire_minutes = 240  (4h, was 720)
;   Global F1 filter      = 1800s (30min cap; only fires hedge if parent SL within 30min of entry)
;   Global regime_gate    = off  (round 5 found regime filter wasn't helping — removing it
;                                   improved NP/DD$ slightly; no sim<->EA calibration gap on regime)
;   Hedge magics: 8111/8222/8333/8444/8555/8666 (v3 reverse).
;
; Round 7 WFO portfolio compare (30pt sim friction, $10k, 1.5%/stream, 77d):
;   v2.1 (no-hedge): NP $+73,832, DD 8.91%, NP/DD$ 9.88, PF 1.74, 1608 trades
;   v3   (+hedge):   NP $+115,532, DD 6.32%, NP/DD$ 14.57, PF 1.74, 2242 trades
;   delta:           NP +$41,700 (+57%), DD -2.59pp (LOWER), NP/DD$ +4.69 (+47% rel), PF flat
;
; Round 7 (2026-05-17) refined R5 with finer tp_mult (step 0.25) + finer sl_mult (step 0.1):
;   - S2/S4/S5/S6 tp_mult 6.0 -> 6.25
;   - S3 sl_mult  1.25 -> 1.2 (S3 tp 8.5 -> 8.75)
;   - buffer_pts swept {0,150,300,450,600}, all 6 streams picked 0 (dim dropped).
;   - 2026-05-19: _ORB_BufferPts + _HEDGE_Sn_BufferPts inputs REMOVED from EA.
;     Entries placed exactly at range_high/range_low (parent) and orig_entry (hedge).
;
; Spread guard: _MaxSpreadPts=60 (Vantage max observed 32pt; sim default raised to 30pt)

; ===== Global account =====
_CapitalProtectionAmount=0.0||0.0||1||0.0||0.0||N
_RiskPct=1.5||1.5||1||1.5||1.5||N
_LotMode=1||1||1||1||1||N
